        "slc_384f05bee27f5705070a45edf5ce4ab61057c9eb7fa667538f4eb38ab5a99d12"
      ],
      "text": "The product exposes a single HTTP API with SSE streaming that normalizes different coding agents' proprietary APIs, so integrations can swap agents via configuration rather than code changes."
    },
